    "content_blocks_section_1": {
      "type": "multirow",
      "blocks": {
        "row_not_too_old": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "video_muted_autoplay": true,
            "caption": "The Truth",
            "title": "<strong>Bladder Leaks Don’t Have to Control the Rest of Your Life</strong>",
            "title_highlight_color": "#000000",
            "text": "<p><strong>If you’re over 50</strong> and dealing with bladder leaks, you’ve probably told yourself it’s “just age.” That’s what most men believe — and that’s exactly why they stay stuck <strong>relying on pads</strong>, planning every outing around restrooms, and feeling embarrassed by simple leaks.</p><p>But bladder leaks are not just an age issue — they’re often a <strong>control issue.</strong> And <strong>control can be rebuilt.</strong></p><p>As the muscles that support bladder control weaken, everyday actions like <strong>coughing, laughing, standing up, or walking</strong> can trigger embarrassing leaks. The sooner you start training those muscles properly, the sooner you can start <strong>taking your life back.</strong></p><p><strong>It’s not too late to stop the cycle.</strong></p>",
            "button_label": "Get 50% Off Today Only",
            "button_link": "#order-form",
            "atc_button_label": "",
            "atc_product": "",
            "atc_skip_cart": false
          }
        },
        "row_introducing": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "video_muted_autoplay": true,
            "caption": "The Solution",
            "title": "<strong>Meet HOSFU™: The Private Way to Rebuild Bladder Control at Home</strong>",
            "title_highlight_color": "#000000",
            "text": "<p><strong>Introducing HOSFU™: Stop Hiding Leaks. Start Training Control.</strong></p><p>Bladder pads only <strong>hide the problem after it happens.</strong></p><p><strong>HOSFU™ helps men train the muscles behind bladder control</strong> — privately, while seated, from home.</p><p>The smart device connects to the HOSFU app and guides each session step by step, helping you <strong>activate the right muscles</strong> and <strong>track your progress over time.</strong></p><p><strong>No clinic visits.</strong></p><p><strong>No awkward conversations.</strong></p><p><strong>No guessing if you’re doing it right.</strong></p><p>Just <strong>10–15 minutes a day</strong> to start rebuilding <strong>control and confidence.</strong></p>",
            "button_label": "Get 50% Off Today Only",
            "button_link": "#order-form",
            "atc_button_label": "",
            "atc_product": "",
            "atc_skip_cart": false
          }
        }
