          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "video_muted_autoplay": true,
            "caption": "Expert Backed",
            "title": "<strong>Designed to Help Men Rebuild Bladder Control</strong>",
            "title_highlight_color": "#000000",
            "text": "<p><strong>HOSFU™</strong> is built around proven bladder control training principles and designed to help men <strong>reduce leaks, regain confidence, and stop relying on pads.</strong></p><p>Its smart guided system helps you train more effectively at home with better consistency and <strong>real-time feedback.</strong></p><p>Plus, every order includes free digital training resources to help you <strong>stay on track and maximize results.</strong></p><p>For far less than the ongoing cost of pads or expensive procedures, HOSFU™ offers a <strong>private, at-home solution</strong> that helps you <strong>take control again.</strong></p>",
