        "row_wait": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "video_muted_autoplay": true,
            "caption": "Act Now",
            "title": "<strong>Don’t Wait Until Leaks Become Your New Normal</strong>",
            "title_highlight_color": "#000000",
            "text": "<p>At first, bladder leaks may seem small — a few drops when you <strong>cough, laugh, or stand up.</strong></p><p>But over time, many men start <strong>changing their life around the problem.</strong></p><p>They stop wearing light pants. They keep extra underwear in the car. They avoid long drives. They <strong>rely on pads.</strong> They look for restrooms everywhere they go.</p><p>That is how a small leak starts <strong>controlling your confidence.</strong></p><p><strong>HOSFU™ helps you stop just hiding the problem and start training bladder control from home.</strong> The app-guided seated routine is simple, private, and takes just <strong>10–15 minutes a day.</strong></p><p>The sooner you start, the sooner you can begin <strong>taking control back.</strong></p>",
            "button_label": "Get 50% Off Today Only",
            "button_link": "#order-form",
            "atc_button_label": "",
            "atc_product": "",
            "atc_skip_cart": false
          }
        }
