    "faq_section": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "faq_1": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "How is this different from doing Kegels on my own?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Most men perform Kegels incorrectly by straining the wrong muscles. HOSFU uses built-in <strong>Biofeedback Sensors</strong> to guide you in real-time. It ensures every contraction is targeted and effective, and tracks your progress via the app so you’re never guessing if it’s working.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "faq_2": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "Is this a medical treatment?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>HOSFU is a non-invasive, high-tech wellness device designed for pelvic floor muscle strengthening. While it is based on urological exercise principles, it is not a medical treatment. If you have chronic conditions or recently had surgery, we recommend consulting your doctor before use.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "faq_3": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "Who is this trainer designed for?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>It’s designed for any man looking to improve bladder control, recover after prostate procedures, or simply strengthen their pelvic floor for better core health and confidence. Whether you’re seeing early signs of weakness or want to be proactive, HOSFU is for you.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "faq_4": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "How often should I use it?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Consistency is key. We recommend one <strong>15-minute session per day</strong>. Most users report noticeable improvements in bladder control and overall confidence within <strong>4 to 6 weeks</strong> of daily, consistent use.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "faq_5": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "Is it rechargeable?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Yes! HOSFU features a standard <strong>Type-C fast-charging port</strong>. One full charge provides enough power for several weeks of daily training, making it easy to stay on track without worrying about batteries.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "faq_6": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "Will it be discreet?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Absolutely. The device operates nearly silently, and its compact design allows for private use at home. Furthermore, we ship every order in <strong>plain, unbranded packaging</strong>—your privacy is our top priority.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "faq_7": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "What if it doesn’t work for me?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>We stand behind our product with a <strong>90-Day Results or Refund Guarantee</strong>. If you don’t see improvement after consistent use, simply contact our support team for a full refund—no questions asked.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        }
      },
